ter (Christoph Waltz), i cui dipinti dei bambini dai grandi occhi divennero un vero e proprio fenomeno negli Stati Uniti tra il 1960 e il 1970. La mano d’artista era di Margaret, ma Walter fece credere al mondo di essere il vero autore dei quadri, conquistando una fama internazionale del tutto immeritata. I due finirono con il divorziare, arrivando ad una battaglia legale senza precedenti: un duello a colpi di pennello per ristabilire la giusta paternità delle opere.","tagline":"Lei l'ha creato, L'ha venduto e l'ha acquistato."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In the late 1950s and early '60s, artist Walter Keane achieves unbelievable fame and success with portraits of saucer-eyed waifs. However, no one realizes that his wife, Margaret, is the real painter behind the brush. Although Margaret is horrified to learn that Walter is passing off her work as his own, she is too meek to protest too loudly. It isn't until the Keanes' marriage comes to an end and a lawsuit follows that the truth finally comes to light.","tagline":"She created it. He sold it. And everyone bought it."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vTlXCcBRRK8uqF6FNIgPGysSwJ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2vTlXCcBRRK8uqF6FNIgPGysSwJ.png","language":"en","width":1276,"height":299},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cA8yg5jmxflzkOKe6YtsvEjVY7d.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cA8yg5jmxflzkOKe6YtsvEjVY7d.png","language":"en","width":1151,"height":1164},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u63VZpXeF4Yz2f8z0o9TloshIAt.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u63VZpXeF4Yz2f8z0o9TloshIAt.png","language":"en","width":653,"height":534}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/203HAjJcLMl7xThcTqZx4zmEGcV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/203HAjJcLMl7xThcTqZx4zmEGcV.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url"